17. Interview Trick Question
Question
	Why is blocking 127.0.0.1 not sufficient to prevent SSRF?
Answer
Because attackers can bypass simple filters using alternative IP formats such as:

2130706433
127.1
[::1]
DNS rebinding
open redirects
URL encoding
A secure defense must validate resolved IP addresses and enforce outbound network restrictions.


